    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "This is a text on games and how to play them intelligently. In this volume, the authors examine games played in clubs, giving case studies for coin and paper-and-pencil games, such as Dots-and-Boxes and Nimstring.\r\n\r\n*Winning Ways for Your Mathematical Plays*: First edition divides the content into two volumes. Second edition is comprised of four volumes. This is the 1st edition, volume 1."
